# Environment
ENV=development

# API
API_HOST=0.0.0.0
API_PORT=8000

# CORS — must match your frontend dev server URL
FRONTEND_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173

# Add your secrets below (never commit real values)
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://maskan_app:change_me@localhost:5433/maskan
# SECRET_KEY=changeme
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# ── Moyasar payments (mediator subscription) ──────────────────────────────
# USE_REAL_PAYMENTS=false (default): /mediators/me/subscribe and /me/renew
# activate instantly with no network call — safe default for local dev/demo.
#
# To enable the real Moyasar charge/webhook flow:
#   1. Get a Moyasar account (https://moyasar.com) and its API keys from the
#      dashboard (Settings → API Keys). Test-mode keys start with "sk_test_"
#      / "pk_test_"; use those before going live.
#   2. Set USE_REAL_PAYMENTS=true and MOYASAR_SECRET_KEY below.
#      MOYASAR_PUBLISHABLE_KEY isn't used by the backend today (Invoice
#      checkout is hosted by Moyasar) but is included for when the frontend
#      needs to embed Moyasar.js directly.
#   3. In the Moyasar dashboard, add a webhook pointing at:
#        <your public backend URL>/api/payments/webhook/moyasar
#      subscribed to at least: payment.paid, payment.failed. Copy the
#      webhook's signing secret into MOYASAR_WEBHOOK_SECRET below — without
#      it, incoming webhooks are still accepted but unsigned (fine for local
#      testing with a tunnel, not for production).
#   4. FRONTEND_ORIGIN (above) is reused as the base for Moyasar's
#      success_url/back_url redirect targets — make sure it's reachable.
#
# Both USE_REAL_PAYMENTS=true AND a non-empty MOYASAR_SECRET_KEY are required
# to activate the real flow; either missing silently falls back to the mock.
# USE_REAL_PAYMENTS=false
# MOYASAR_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...
# MOYASAR_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
# MOYASAR_WEBHOOK_SECRET=...
